common='''Use the two frozen common identity/setup sheets for Iven, Mara, the single jellyfish-turtle and this simple canal landing. Apply only the selected provisional rendering treatment. Both people remain unmistakably adult. Iven27: slim dancer build, refined long oval face, wine-red low-tied long hair, pearl earring, ivory poet sleeves/plain plum waistcoat/black slim trousers/black boots. Mara38: powerful plus-size body, warm brown skin, broad nose/full lips, thick blue-black braid, plain ivory ceramic cropped vest/magenta trousers/wrapped sandals/one simple blue upper-arm band. Creature: one large-pony jellyfish-turtle, broad low shell/translucent umbrella dome/calm round face/exactly four broad tentacles. One broad arch, one straight canal, one low dry ledge, one plain handwheel post and one sluice. Quiet daylight, large open value areas. No captions, dialogue, SFX, signatures, annotations, labels or diagram arrows inside the raster. Keep the frozen panel composition and physical state identical across the three rendering treatments. Do not turn the blocking specification into technical diagram artwork.'''
text=['# Frozen panel briefs','',common,'']
